---
/**
 * PreviewNotice — the licensing disclaimer bar above the header on every page.
 *
 * Figma: desktop 33831:164035, tablet 33918:78333, mobile 33920:80028.
 * Figma steps the type 10/12/14px per frame; this bar scales fluidly instead
 * (see --text-fluid-xs / --spacing-notice-* in tokens.css), so no breakpoint
 * classes. One text colour throughout — Figma's desktop-only #d8d8f0 is
 * dropped in favour of the white/90 the other two frames use.
 *
 * In flow, not sticky: it scrolls away and the sticky header pins beneath it.
 */
---

<aside aria-label="Site notice" class="bg-notice px-notice-x py-notice-y">
  <p class="mx-auto max-w-5xl text-center text-fluid-xs text-balance text-ink-fixed/90">
    This is a preview website. Licensing is in progress, and all properties and
    figures shown are illustrative and not an offer to invest.
  </p>
</aside>
